	(gr_text "0) Recheck P- and P+ diff pair clearences if you are planning to use Probe connecor as USB/CAN connector\n1) Take length of your standoffs as height of your motor.\n   For LDO pancacke motor I would recommend to use 0.5 spacer/washer along with standoff since their {dblquote}ears{dblquote} are 1.5mm in thickness.\n   Moons motors can be used without spacers, only standoffs\n2) It is recomended to use some soft non-conductive material to prevent short curcuit\nStick it to back side of your motor"
		(at 121.6 124.1 0)
